{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dqwSvXPz8y1793633927.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國股市造好，上日急挫逾500點的道指早段回升約600點。</p><p></p><p>道指高開逾200點，一開市就突破52,000點，其後升幅擴大至逾600點。納指早段升逾200點，升至25,600點水平。</p><p></p><p>科技股個別發展，亞馬遜升約百分之4。</p><p></p><p>晶片股美光科技和閃迪，則跌百分之1至2。英特爾再跌近百分之3。</p><p></p><p>國際油價急挫，石油股雪佛龍和埃克森美孚，早段跌百分之1至2。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:41:40.730070+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T15:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T17:58:23.900263+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T16:38:23.986697+00:00","content_hash":"e25a394c169d09ac25d85cbc829aec4b7700ff6a0a90c8dd51b3a6627f7291fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}